       }
      ],
      "text": "Prochlorperazine:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " thiazides may accentuate its orthostatic hypotension; it may counteract the antihypertensive effect of guanethidine and related drugs; with propranolol, plasma levels of both drugs rise."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
